  "_note": [
    "First bb-allowlist parity battery. Exercises the surface in",
    "src/Aot/Runtime/java/lang/Math.php — abs/min/max/sqrt/pow/",
    "floor/ceil/round/addExact/subtractExact/multiplyExact/",
    "negateExact/floorDiv/floorMod/signum.",
    "",
    "JSON integer literals decode to Long; reflection picks the",
    "long-typed overload. JSON float literals decode to Double;",
    "reflection picks the double-typed overload. The MVP case",
    "battery sticks to overloads where this matches the bb-fill",
    "shim's polymorphic dispatch. Int/long boundary cases that",
    "differ between Java overloads (Integer.MIN_VALUE etc.) get",
    "added when descriptor-mangled methods land."
